---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---
<Base title="Got it" description="Your audit request is in." noindex>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-site max-w-2xl">
      <p class="eyebrow">Request received</p>
      <h1 class="h2 mt-3">Got it.</h1>
      <div class="prose-site mt-6 text-ink-soft">
        <p>Here's what happens in the next 24 hours: I read what you sent, look at your store if you gave me a URL, and reply from <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`} class="link">{site.contactEmail}</a> with a couple of times for a 30-minute call.</p>
        <p>If you don't see anything by the end of the next business day, check spam, then email me directly.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-8"><a href="/#proof" class="link">Read the case studies while you wait →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <!-- Phase 3: GA4 / Ads conversion event fires on this page -->
</Base>
